    <briefdescription>
<para>Feedback-control loop that adapts flush batch size to <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_t_s_store" kindref="compound">TSStore</ref> write latency. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tracks an EWMA of observed write latencies and scales <computeroutput>current_batch_size</computeroutput> inversely. When latency exceeds the configured SLO, <computeroutput>isBackpressure()</computeroutput> returns true so that the <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_t_s_auto_buffer_1acf21c940f798f75f2977f8a215cc2966" kindref="member">add()</ref></computeroutput> path can block producers at the high-watermark. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
